  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Cameras that render to a render texture appear to work as intended. However, cameras that are left by themselves to render over the player camera, stop rendering when the player has switched worlds. When the player first logs into vrchat all local cameras work as intended.\n\nI am only able to test this on desktop mode right now.\n\nI have had limited success in getting the camera to display again with animation overrides and by attaching objects to the camera I can see that the camera or at least the object containing the camera component should still exist on the avatar. Nothing I have attempted to do could get the camera to display again over the player camera 100% of the time. It would consistently stop displaying when loaded into a new world.",
